1. # REMOVE MISLEADING AUTHORIZATION CLAIMS

This is the MOST IMPORTANT requirement.

The business must NOT claim to be:

- Sony Authorised Service Centre
- vu Authorised Service Centre
- LG Authorised Service Centre
- Panasonic Authorised Service Centre
- Any manufacturer's official service centre

unless actual authorization documentation exists.

Replace potentially misleading wording such as:

"Authorised Sony Service Centre"
"Sony Authorised Service"
"Official Sony Repair Centre"
"Company Authorised Service Centre"

with truthful wording such as:

"TV Repair Service"
"Independent TV Repair Service"
"TV Repair at Home"
"TV & Home Appliance Repair"

Brand names may be used only to identify products that the business services.

Add a clearly visible disclaimer:

"Authorised Services is an independent repair service provider and is not affiliated with or officially authorised by any specific manufacturer unless explicitly stated."

Do NOT hide this disclaimer in tiny text.

